 I want the order \"email, score\" because that\norder reads better for people entering grades in gradebook files.\n\nI have to add the //nolint directive because otherwise govet will try to\noptimize the struct. In this case, I can live with the extra bytes.", "created_at": "2025-06-17T11:19:49Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7a02b27b68c9dd1e33fe8de4785c7342f92c9c58", "message": "fix: add AssignmentCategoriesSortedByLabel", "created_at": "2025-06-17T01:12:24Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de315b086dcf69858a2ab96d689a7fc788e2c003", "message": "fix: add class.go and fix imports (again)", "created_at": "2025-06-17T01:05:53Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4c2b82bcad2c108576c5aeff86b8ae153f2a80fd", "message": "fix: correct import paths", "created_at": "2025-06-17T00:34:10Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0ac12c29dfa41f288a8ba17b268ec591cd467192", "message": "feat: initial full implementation", "created_at": "2025-06-17T00:19:49Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "53d2ea7a05d3e3532e0e96d0ed25bcdf8b6d21e7", "message": "chore: update for 1.23", "created_at": "2024-10-07T22:38:50Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4248ac6aa5790059741b453a25f803f5c39272e5", "message": "feat: improved validation and updated linting\n\n+ The validation code is now cleaner and more logical.\n+ The linter has updated defaults and I'm using `wsl` again.", "created_at": "2023-08-26T17:27:01Z", "repo": "gradebook", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "654a648037bcdd6dcb0803cd84cbd42435508acc", "message": "feat: add validation methods and document